  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Mariko 9",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 50,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji ichek, Amwawok iman ale, Mi yu alak eng’ chu tonondos, che magoi chamjam meet, agoi kogeer bounatetab Jehovah konyonei eng’ kamuktaet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Waletab ge ne bo Jesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingobata betusiek lo komut Jesu Petero, ak Jakobo, ak Johana, kotogosta tulwet ne koi koba uwak ichegei: ak kiwalak eng’ tainywa: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kilil bich ngoroikyik mising’, ko u teluchi; mami mwetindet ng’ony ne imuchi komwet koleelagitu ko u choto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitook eng’ tainywa Elija ak Musa: ak king’alaljindos koboto Jesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiwol Petero kolenji Jesu Konetindoni, mie ketebi eng’ yu: mie keteech keriosiek somok; neng’ung’ age, ko bo Musa age, ko bo Elija age. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kima kongen kit ne wolu; amu kiiyweis mising’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kinyo boldet kotuch ichek: ak kimong’ kutit eng’ boldet, kole, Ni ko Werinnyu, chamanennyu: ogas okwek inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kigusgong’ ngunoto kogeer komoswek tugul, ko mata kogeer chi, kobate Jesu inegei ak icheget.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingota kochorugei eng’ tulwet, koete ichek, kolenji, amat komwachi chi tuguk che kagogeer agoi kong’eet Weritab chi eng’ che kibek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kirib ng’olyondonoto koteebegei ichegei agobo kaguiyetab ng’eetyet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiteebe inendet kole, Mwaei sirik kole, kanyol konyo Elija korok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji ichek, Iman, nyonei Elija korok, ak koweech tuguk tugul ko u ye kinye: ak kiteptoi ano si kesir agobo Weritab chi kele nyalili eng’ tuguk che chang’ ak kiit koek buch? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago amwawok ale, kigonyo Elija, ak kiyachi agine kit age tugul ne kimachei ichek ko u ye kigisir agobo inendet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kisoobi werit ne tinyei tamirmiriet ne namat kut",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kigabwa ole mi alamalyet, kogeer tuiyet ne o ko kayiem ichek, ak sirik che kiteepse ichek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak yeityo anyun, ye kingogeer tuiyet komugul inendet, kokwong’io mising’, ak koruai ole mi, kogat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiteebe ichek kole, Oteebege nee ak icheget? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kowolji chito age eng’ tuiyet, kolenji, Konetindoni, kaamutun werinnyu, ne tinyei tamirmiriet ne namat kut; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak oldo tugul ole namjin eng’ kimnatet, kowirjinoti ng’ony: ak kotabugoni, ak konyeei kelek, ak kochuchui: ak kaamwachi alamalyeng’ung’ koon komanda; ago ma imuch.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiwolji anyun ichek kolenji, Ee, ibinda ne matinyei kayanet, atebye kobotok kot kotianit? Amuitoiywok kot kotianit? Omutwa inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiimutyi ichek inendet Jesu: ak ye kingogeer inendet, kobirabirto ngunoto tamirmiriet mising’; ak kobutyi ng’ony, komelmelgei ak kotabugan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiteebe kwandanyi, kolenji, Kinamei koboch au kiito? Ak kile, Koboch ko lakwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kigowirji konyil che chang’ ma ak ole mi beek, komachei kobar inendet: ak ngimuchi iyai kiy age tugul, irirenech ge, ak itoretech. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Jesu, Ngimuchi! Imugaksei tuguk tugul eng’ inendet ne iyani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeityo anyun kowaach kwandab lakwanato, ak kole, Ayani; toreta eng’ bistoennyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogeer Jesu tuiyet koruou tugul, koger kong’ tamirmiriet ne muruon, kolenji, Inye, tamirmiriet ne namat kut ak ko i ming’at, kang’atin ale, mong’u eng’ inendet, ak amatata ichut inendet kogeny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingo kagowaach ak kobirto inendet mising’, komanda: ak koigei lakwet ne kagome; kot komwa che chang’ kole, Kagome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kinam Jesu eut, ak kong’eet; kotonon anyun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kingo kakwo go, koteebe alamalyennyi inendet komi ichegei, kole, Amu nee si ma kimuch achek keon? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji ichek, Maimuchi komanda ne u ni eng’ kiy tugul, kobate saet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sib kemwaei ne bo aeng’ meetab Jesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiba anyun eng’ oloto, ak kobun kwenutab Galili; ak kima mach konai chi age tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kiineti alamalyennyi kolenjin, kindoi Weritab chi eunekab bik, ak kobar inendet; ak ye kagebar, kong’eet kogeny, ko kagobata betusiek somogu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kima nai ichek ng’olyondonoto, ak kiiywei koteebe inendet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kanetisiet agobo kaming’inetab ge",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kibwa Kapernaum: ak ye kimi go koteebe ichek kole, Ka nee ng’alek che komwaonu eng’ oret? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kisisyo: amu kitiitos ichegei eng’ ichegei eng’ oret kolen ng’o ne o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiteb ng’ony anyun, ak koguur choto taman ak aeng’; ak kolenji, Ngo machei chi koek ne bo tai, koegu ne bo let eng’ tugul, ak koek otwogindetab tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kinam lakwet ne ming’in ak konde kwenunywa: ak koganab eng’ eunekyik, ak kolenji, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Age tugul ne taachei age eng’ lagochu mengech eng’ kainennyu, ko kataacha: ak age tugul ne taacha, ko mataacha ane, ago inendet ne kiiyokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Agobo muitaet",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilenji Johana inendet, Konetindoni, kogigeer chi koonei oik eng’ kaineng’ung’: ak kogiete, amu koma kosubwech. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kile Jesu, Amoete: amu mami chi ne yaei boisiet ne bo kimnatet eng’ kainennyu, ak komuch kochepchebit komwaitaena yaitio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu inendet ne magirindoech ko nenyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu age tugul ne inagok beekab kikombet oee, amu o bo Kristo, amwawok iman, ale, mabetyin melektanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mamie kinach bik alk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak age tugul ne inachi age eng’ chu mengech che iyana, ko kaigai eng’ inendet kirooch kaatinnyi koitab bai ne o, ak kewirji nyanjet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ngonachin eung’ung’, itil: kaigai eng’ inye imong’ji sobondo i bo mugung’, kosiir itinye eunek aeng’ ak iwe Gehenna, mat ne ma misoksei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ole mabegu kutikwak, ama misoksei mat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ngonachin keldang’ung’, itil: kaigai eng’ inye imong’ji sobondo i bo kelok, kosiir kewirjin Gehenna i bo kelyek aeng’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ole mabegu kutikwak, ama misoksei mat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ngonachin kondang’ung’, ibalu: kaigai eng’ inye iit bounatetab Jehovah i bo kong’ak, kosiir kewirjin Gehenna itinye konyek aeng’; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ole mabegu kutikwak, ama misoksei mat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kindoi chi age tugul munyuk eng’ mat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miachen munyuk: ago ngo bet anyinyindab munyuk, ko ta ondoi nee si kochom? Ingotebe munyuk mugulelwekwok, ak otebi eng’ kalyet okwege eng’ okwege.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
